<div class="guide-styles" data-zaf-dynamic="article" id="guide-body" lang="en">Welcome to Wowhead's Pre-Raid Best in Slot Gear list for Restoration Shaman Healer in Wrath of the Lich King Classic for Phase 4. This guide will list the recommended gear for your class and role, containing gear sourced from Heroics, reputation rewards, and the new Raid loot added to Titan Rune Dungeons.<h2 class="heading-size-2" id="best-in-slot-gear">Restoration Shaman Healer Best in Slot Gear, Gems, and Enchants - Pre-Raid Phase 4</h2>Unfortunately, Restoration <a class="icontiny c7" data-game="wow" data-type="class" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/shaman">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/class_shaman.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Shaman</span></a> Tier 9 set has bad set bonuses, making it worthwhile to keep aiming for Tier 8's 4p bonus <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/spell=64922/item-shaman-t8-restoration-4p-bonus">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/trade_engineering.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Item - Shaman T8 Restoration 4P Bonus</span></a>, even though its individual gear pieces are weaker than the now available 245 tier 9 pieces. <br/>
<br/>
<b>Non-Heroic /<wbr/> Hard Mode raids are so easy that we recommend you to jump straight into them once you hit max level!</b> This is especially true as a healer role, where maximum throughput from everyone in the raid is rarely necessary to kill bosses.<br/>
<br/>
<b>Spell Haste</b> is a particularly strong stat which increases your throughput and ability to reactively heal. This does come at a cost to your Mana pool if you are spamming heals without pause, however. Gemming pure <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=40128/quick-kings-amber">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelcrafting_gem_38.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Quick King's Amber</span></a> is a strong throughput option and recommended now that powerful trinkets such as <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=45535/show-of-faith">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/spell_holy_improvedresistanceauras.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Show of Faith</span></a> and <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=47271/solace-of-the-fallen">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/achievement_dungeon_ulduar77_25man.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Solace of the Fallen</span></a> can be farmed from dungeons.<br/>
<br/>
