<br/>
<br/>You can find more crafted gear of potential use in  <a href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/items/armor/min-level:232/side:2/class:7/weights:250:249:248:247:123:103:96:61:23/weight-values:73.077:73.077:73.077:100:3.846:4.615:3.846:4.615:3.846?filter=123:24:238:119:86;1:3:4:3:11;0:0:4:0:0#items">crafted gear</a> to fill in for any weaker gear slots!<h2 class="heading-size-2" id="best-gems">Best Gems for Restoration Shaman Healer - Pre-Raid Phase 4</h2>
<ul>
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">Meta Socket - <a class="q3 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=41401/insightful-earthsiege-diamond">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelcrafting_shadowspirit_02.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Insightful Earthsiege Diamond</span></a></div></li>
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">Red Socket - <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=40155/reckless-ametrine">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelcrafting_gem_39.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Reckless Ametrine</span></a></div></li>
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">Blue Socket - <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=40134/royal-dreadstone">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelcrafting_gem_40.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Royal Dreadstone</span></a></div></li>
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">Yellow Socket - <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/item=40128/quick-kings-amber">
<img loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_jewelcrafting_gem_38.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Quick King's Amber</span></a></div></li></ul>Pure Haste gems (other than meta gem activation needs) should be fine with the powerful trinkets recommended above, but if you are having Mana issues consider using more hybrid gems in place of pure Haste, instead.<h2 class="heading-size-2" id="best-enchants">Best Enchants for Restoration Shaman Healer - Pre-Raid Phase 4</h2>
<ul class="last">
<li>
